## Why This Is Asked

Assesses practical ability to design region-specific, tenant-isolated data pipelines with proper security, onboarding, and DR considerations.

## Key Concepts

- Regional data residency per tenant
- Streaming ETL with Dataflow
- Idempotency and deduplication
- Tenant lifecycle automation (onboard/offboard)
- Security: CMEK, IAM least privilege
- Observability with Cloud Monitoring/Logging
- Disaster recovery and cost controls

